	"VersionName": "1.1.0",
	"FriendlyName": "UniGLB - Universal GLB/FBX Character Importer",
	"Description": "Universal GLB / FBX / OBJ character importer with automatic normalization onto the UE5 Manny skeleton. Every imported humanoid character shares one skeleton for a single universal animation library. Supports Mixamo, Ready Player Me, Meshy AI, Character Creator 4, DAZ Genesis 8/9, Blender Rigify, and more.",
	"Category": "Importers",
	"CreatedBy": "hanibes",
